{'symbol': 'BKNG', 'date': '2022-04-18 08:00:00', 'title': 'OMRI MORGENSHTERN NAMED CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF AGODA', 'text': "CURRENT CHIEF EXECUTIVE, JOHN BROWN, ASSUMES ROLE OF CHAIRPERSON AT AGODA NORWALK, CONN. , APRIL 18, 2022\xa0 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BOOKING HOLDINGS, THE WORLD'S LEADING PROVIDER OF ONLINE TRAVEL AND RELATED SERVICES, AND PARENT COMPANY OF CONSUMER-FACING BRANDS INCLUDING BOOKING.COM , PRICELINE, AGODA, RENTALCARS.COM , KAYAK AND OPENTABLE, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT OMRI MORGENSHTERN HAS BEEN NAMED CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF AGODA EFFECTIVE JULY 1, 2022."}